{"schema":1,"revision":70530479,"page":{"pageid":3749956,"title":"頭胸部","displayTitle":"頭胸部","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:General_malacostracan_en.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/General_malacostracan_en.svg/330px-General_malacostracan_en.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"172\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1.2\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/General_malacostracan_en.svg/960px-General_malacostracan_en.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4843\" data-file-height=\"2776\" /></a><figcaption>一隻<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BB%9F%E7%94%B2%E7%B6%B1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"軟甲綱\">軟甲綱</a>生物的構造圖，黃色區域為頭胸部</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>頭胸部</b>（<b>cephalothorax</b>）是許多<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AF%80%E8%82%A2%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"節肢動物\">節肢動物</a>的一個<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%94%E6%AE%B5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"體段（頁面不存在）\">體段</a>，包括相連的<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A0%AD%E9%83%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"頭部\">頭部</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%83%B8%E9%83%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"胸部\">胸部</a>，與<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%85%B9%E9%83%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"腹部\">腹部</a>截然相別。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Biology&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Biology-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> 術語\"cephalothorax\"一詞來自<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%8C%E8%87%98%E8%AA%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"希臘語\">希臘語</a><span title=\"希臘語文本\"><span lang=\"el\"><a href=\"https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/%CE%BA%CE%B5%CF%86%CE%B1%CE%BB%CE%AE\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikt:κεφαλή\">κεφαλή</a></span></span>（頭部，<span title=\"希臘語文本\"><span lang=\"el\">kephalé</span></span>）和<span title=\"希臘語文本\"><span lang=\"el\">θώραξ</span></span>（胸部，<span title=\"希臘語文本\"><span lang=\"el\"><a href=\"https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/thorax\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikt:thorax\">thórax</a></span></span>）。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> 最常見於<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9E%AF%E8%82%A2%E4%BA%9E%E9%96%80\" title=\"螯肢亞門\">螯肢亞門</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B2%E6%AE%BC%E4%BA%9E%E9%96%80\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"甲殼亞門\">甲殼亞門</a>的生物身上，在其他諸如<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%AD%E8%B6%B3%E4%BA%9E%E9%96%80\" title=\"六足亞門\">六足亞門</a>生物身上頭胸依舊是分離的。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Biology&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Biology-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/%E9%B2%8E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"鱟\">鱟</a>和許多甲殼亞門動物的頭胸部都有<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B2%E6%AE%BC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"甲殼\">甲殼</a>覆蓋。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考文獻\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8D.BB\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A0%AD%E8%83%B8%E9%83%A8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style